# Rules Register — Declarative Rule Index

> Lightweight index replacing full rule-file loads every turn.
> The LLM loads only this file by default and expands the matching module on Router trigger words.

## Router Mapping

| Trigger word | Expand file | Token estimate |
|--------|---------|:--:|
| {trigger1} | {file1} | ~{estimate} |
| {trigger2} | {file2} | ~{estimate} |
| ... | ... | ... |

## Global always-on rules

1. {rule1}
2. {rule2}
3. {rule3}

## Decision Pipeline

```
[script pre-compute] → [DecisionState JSON] → [LLM logical decision] → [operator output] → [validator]
```

Script layer does numeric computation; LLM layer does only logical orchestration.
